‘Space agencies have been faking all photos from space for decades – directed from the very top.’ {{1}}
‘The flag appearing to wave in a Moon photo cannot be a mistake – it was deliberately staged that way.’ {{2}}
‘Satellite images as evidence against it? Faked – that just shows how powerful the fakers are.’ {{3}}
‘Space agencies in several countries have agreed to hide the Earth's true shape.’ {{4}}
‘Film studios made advances in the very year the rocket launched – that sort of thing doesn't just happen.’ {{5}}
‘The less evidence we find, the clearer it becomes how professionally everything has been covered up.’ {{6}}
‘All the world's pilots and astronomers are in on it and sworn to secrecy.’ {{7}}
‘Experts disproving our claim just proves all the more that they are in on it.’ {{8}}
‘Two countries were rivals in the race to the Moon – at exactly the same time? That can't be a coincidence.’ {{9}}
